@startuml

component "Android client" as Client

node "Raspberry Pi server" {
    component "HTTP sessions" as Sessions
    component Application
    database SQLite
    component "XGBoost model" as Model
    component "MH-Z19B\nUART sensor" as Sensor
    component "GPIO LED" as LED
}

cloud "OpenWeather" as Weather

Client -> Sessions : JSON/HTTP :12345\n(no TLS or authentication)
Sessions -> Application : validated commands
Application --> Sessions : JSON responses
Application --> SQLite : indoor CO₂ ppm; outdoor CO µg/m³
Application --> Sensor : 9-byte UART frames
Application --> LED : on/off
Application --> Model : 24-hour CO₂ forecast
Application -> Weather : HTTPS (API key)

@enduml
